  message: "DATA POINT from WI-kibah's branch (jgstern-agent/fix/kibah, not merged). After WI-kugap's commit there restamps resolved receiver calls by syntax, a value-receiver call bound to a FIELD reads call_construct=method with a dst kind field. Counts (analyze_go, ast_call, call_construct=method, resolved dst kind field) on the branch: alertmanager 78, coredns 23, cert-manager 158, prometheus 312 (origin/dev, same filter, where most of these were stamped function: 79 / 22 / 153 / 306 with construct method). The function / struct / type half of the same short-name pick is filed as WI-surid-gajon-soduk-firol-vapog-kopuj-fazik-tirom. Not split by func-typed vs value field."  # 994d
